ns-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">참여방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">원킷(Onekit)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">-&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">통합정보시스템 -&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">학사행정&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">- 수업 -</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">강의평가&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">평가내용&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">기본문항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수업유형별문항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">(</span></font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">선택</span></font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">서술문항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별 적용방안&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">선</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">택된</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;수업유형이 반영되어 강의평가 문항 제공(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">★</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">교과목에 배분된 수업유형별 문항이 모두 적용)</span></u></span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">본 강의평가 설문에 대한&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">익명성은 철저하게 보장</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">이 되며</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학생이 평가한 결과는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">성적부여에 영향을 미치지 않는 성적 확정 이후에&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 해당교수에게 열람됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">강의평가 기간</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">중에</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">평가를 실시하지 않은 <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0);\">과목</span></b></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">은 해당 학기</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">성적열람기간에&nbsp;</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">성적을 열람할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">.</span></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
